As the next Chairman of the Senate Finance Committee, with jurisdiction over federal tax policy, social safety net and health care programs, and foreign trade agreements, Senator Crapo will oversee the confirmation process for each of the nominees within the Committee’s jurisdiction. For more news and information about his meetings with those nominees, please visit the Committee’s website here.

